From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: wenhua.liu <wenhua.liu@haitaichina.com>
Date: Fri, 9 May 2026 12:00:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Skip glibc <sys/ifunc.h> on harmony in PA aarch64 support

partition_alloc/aarch64_support.h:18 enables HAS_HW_CAPS (and thereby
includes <sys/ifunc.h>) whenever PA detects IS_ANDROID or IS_LINUX.
HarmonyOS uses musl libc which advertises __linux__ (so PA's
build_config.h sets PA_IS_LINUX) but doesn't ship <sys/ifunc.h> -
that header is glibc-specific.

Exclude OHOS with a `!defined(__OHOS__)` guard so PA falls through
to the #else branch (forward-declares struct __ifunc_arg_t and
returns false from IsBtiEnabled / IsMteEnabled). This is the only
PA source that needed an IS_HARMONY-aware adjustment to compile
under target_os=harmony with use_partition_alloc=true.

With use_partition_alloc=true on HarmonyOS, PA's own .cc files supply
PartitionAllocHooks, PartitionRoot, ThreadCache, OnNoMemory, aliases, and
the related allocator internals.
---
 .../src/partition_alloc/aarch64_support.h         | 8 +++++++-
 1 file changed, 7 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/allocator/partition_allocator/src/partition_alloc/aarch64_support.h b/allocator/partition_allocator/src/partition_alloc/aarch64_support.h
index ffd93db..5274ad6 100644
--- a/allocator/partition_allocator/src/partition_alloc/aarch64_support.h
+++ b/allocator/partition_allocator/src/partition_alloc/aarch64_support.h
@@ -15,7 +15,13 @@
 #include "partition_alloc/build_config.h"
 #include "partition_alloc/buildflags.h"

-#if PA_BUILDFLAG(IS_ANDROID) || PA_BUILDFLAG(IS_LINUX)
+// HarmonyOS uses musl libc, which doesn't ship <sys/ifunc.h> even though
+// it advertises __linux__ (and therefore PA_BUILDFLAG(IS_LINUX)=1). The
+// AArch64 IFUNC machinery here is glibc-specific, so exclude OHOS with a
+// `__OHOS__` guard so PA's #else fallback (forward-declared
+// struct __ifunc_arg_t) takes over and the IsBtiEnabled / IsMteEnabled
+// helpers compile to "return false".
+#if (PA_BUILDFLAG(IS_ANDROID) || PA_BUILDFLAG(IS_LINUX)) && !defined(__OHOS__)
 #define HAS_HW_CAPS
 #endif

--
2.34.1
